---
pagination:
  data: paperPages
  size: 1
  alias: paper
permalink: "/papers/{{ paper.slug }}.bib"
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{#- Per-paper BibTeX sibling of /papers/<slug>.html (#1254). The string itself
    is built once in paperPages.js, so this template only writes it out: the
    .bib file, the download button on the paper page and the bulk export on the
    by-paper view all render the same bytes.

    No layout and no trailing newline juggling: `| safe` is required because
    Nunjucks would otherwise HTML-escape the braces and ampersands that make
    the file valid BibTeX. Excluded from collections so it stays out of the
    sitemap and the feed. -#}
{{ paper.bibtex | safe }}
